{"cti_reasoning":"S has phase = ADAPT (2'd2), which is not DONE, so P holds. start_seen = 0 violates the clause "phase[1]==0 || start_seen", because ADAPT can only be entered from ARMED, which sets start_seen. With i_ce low the engine idles in S indefinitely; one enabled step with upd_cnt = N-1 moves phase to DONE while start_seen stays 0, so the armed property fails.","cti_state":[{"signal":"phase","value":"2'd2"},{"signal":"upd_cnt","value":"64'd3"},{"signal":"arm_seen","value":"1'b1"},{"signal":"start_seen","value":"1'b0"},{"signal":"q_seen","value":"1'b1"},{"signal":"hist_cnt","value":"2'd2"},{"signal":"hist","value":"2'b00"},{"signal":"mu","value":"64'd1"},{"signal":"coef0","value":"64'd0"},{"signal":"coef1","value":"64'd0"}],"invariants":["phase == 2'd0 || arm_seen","phase[1] == 1'b0 || start_seen","hist_cnt <= 2'd2"],"verilog":"module dfe_ss_lms (
