{"cti_reasoning":"The state first_rise=1, dir=1, pos=0, duty=MAX, headroom=MAX, presc=PRESC_MAX satisfies P because duty and headroom both equal MAX, so A1 and A2 hold. It violates R because duty != pos<<32 (MAX vs 0). With en=0 it holds there forever; one en=1 cycle fires a tick with pos<NSTEPS, so duty becomes MAX+STEP > MAX while first_rise is still 1, breaking A1.","cti_state":[{"signal":"first_rise","value":"1'b1"},{"signal":"dir","value":"1'b1"},{"signal":"pos","value":"64'h0000000000000000"},{"signal":"duty","value":"64'h8000000000000000"},{"signal":"headroom","value":"64'h8000000000000000"},{"signal":"presc","value":"64'd999"},{"signal":"pwm_cnt","value":"64'd0"}],"invariants":["duty == (pos << 32)","headroom == 64'h8000000000000000 - duty","pos <= 64'h0000000080000000","!first_rise || dir","presc <= 64'd999"],"verilog":"module hbpf_breathe (
