{"cti_reasoning":"With busy=1, timer=1 and rnd=0, the countdown has not expired, so P holds; with ce low the engine sits here indefinitely. R requires timer+rnd==8 while busy, and here 1+0=1, so R is violated. One ce step gives timer=0, rnd=1, busy=1 (rnd was not 5, so the job does not finish). On the next clock P sees $past(busy)=1 with $past(timer)==0 and fails.","cti_state":[{"signal":"busy","value":"1'b1"},{"signal":"timer","value":"32'd1"},{"signal":"rnd","value":"32'd0"},{"signal":"pv","value":"1'b1"}],"invariants":["!busy || (timer + rnd == 32'd8)","!busy || (rnd <= 32'd5)"],"verilog":"module ctr_drbg_engine (
