{"cti_reasoning": "S has armed=1 and inflight=3'd4, so P (armed -> inflight <= 4) holds, but it violates R because the latency shift register is empty (popcount(pipe)=0 != 4); the design can idle in S forever with i_ce low, and one step with i_ce=1, issue=1 gives inflight = 4 + 1 - pipe[3] = 3'd5 while armed stays high, breaking P.", "cti_state": [{"signal": "armed", "value": "1'b1"}, {"signal": "inflight", "value": "3'd4"}, {"signal": "pipe", "value": "4'b0000"}], "invariants": ["inflight == ({2'b00,pipe[0]} + {2'b00,pipe[1]} + {2'b00,pipe[2]} + {2'b00,pipe[3]})"], "verilog": "module inflight_tracker (
