{"cti_reasoning":"State S has the sticky arm register set (armed=1) but a shadow peak of only 3, which is impossible in real operation since armed is only set on the same cycle the peak is raised to at least 8; S satisfies P vacuously because the gate output is low. With step=0 the design sits in S forever, and one step with voice=1 drives cnt from 3 to 4, so gate rises and peak becomes 4, giving armed && gate with peak = 4 < 8, which breaks P.","cti_state":[{"signal":"cnt","value":"4'd3"},{"signal":"peak","value":"4'd3"},{"signal":"armed","value":"1'b1"},{"signal":"gate","value":"1'b0"}],"invariants":["cnt <= 4'd12","peak <= 4'd12","peak >= cnt","!armed || peak >= 4'd8","!gate || cnt >= 4'd4"],"verilog":"// Voice-activity frame accumulator with saturating speech-run counter.
