{"cti_reasoning":"State S has armed=1 and occ=3'd3, so P (occ<=3 while armed) holds, but the pending-mask is empty so occ does not equal the popcount of ack_pend — R clause 1 is false. Holding i_ce low keeps S forever; then one cycle with i_ce=1 and i_req=4'b0001 grants line 0 with no ack, so occ increments to 3'd4 while armed is still 1, violating P.","cti_state":[{"signal":"occ","value":"3'd3"},{"signal":"ack_pend","value":"4'b0000"},{"signal":"armed","value":"1'b1"},{"signal":"last","value":"2'd3"}],"invariants":["occ == {2'b00, ack_pend[0]} + {2'b00, ack_pend[1]} + {2'b00, ack_pend[2]} + {2'b00, ack_pend[3]}","!armed || !ack_pend[3]"],"verilog":"module rr_credit_arb (
